     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1050035">VEX.128.F3.0F38.W0 D2 /r</para>
      <para unique="1050036">VPDPWSUD xmm1, xmm2, xmm3/m128</para>
      <para unique="1050037"/>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1050041">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1050043">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1050045">AVX_VNNI_INT16</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1050047">Multiply groups of 2 pairs of unsigned words in xmm3/m128 with corresponding signed words of xmm2, summing those products and adding them to the doubleword result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
